# {{ project_name }} — Development Guide

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
uv sync

# 2. Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your API keys

# 3. Start development server
make dev
# or: uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

