## 🔧 Configuration

All settings are managed via environment variables. See `.env.example` for all options.

Key settings:
- `LLM_PROVIDER` — Which AI provider to use (openai, anthropic, google, groq, etc.)
- `LLM_MODEL` — Model name (gpt-4o, claude-sonnet-4-20250514, gemini-2.0-flash, etc.)
{% if context.get("rag", False) %}
- `VECTOR_STORE` — Vector database backend (faiss, pinecone, qdrant, etc.)
- `EMBEDDING_MODEL` — Embedding model for RAG
{% endif %}

## 🧪 Testing

```bash
# Run all tests
make test

# Run specific test
uv run pytest tests/test_health.py -v

# With coverage
uv run pytest tests/ --cov=app --cov-report=html
```

## 📡 API Endpoints

Once running, visit:
- **Swagger UI**: http://localhost:8000/docs
- **ReDoc**: http://localhost:8000/redoc
- **Health**: http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

